window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Nadine has fought to earn her rightful place on the coven’s council, but witch hunts continue to plague Octavia Falls. The priestesses who rule seek to divide their people and silence anyone who objects. Nadine is their prime target, and they won’t hesitate to hurt anyone who gets in their way— including the people Nadine cares for most. She must uncover the final clues to locate the Oaken Wands before the priestesses destroy the coven and all magic is lost to witchkind forever. <br> <br> Lucas has chosen to lead an uprising at Nadine’s side, but to stand a chance against the priestesses, he must become a master of Death and join the ranks of the most powerful warlocks to ever live. Faced with a cunning demon and the threat of a noose, Lucas will journey into hellfire to protect his family and his coven from the evil forces that wish to kill them all. <br> <br> The fate of the coven has never been more uncertain. Nadine and Lucas will either unite the coven as one… or lead it to its permanent destruction.</p>"; 
